{"2995740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FACEMELTER", "steam_appid": 2995740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FACEMELTER is a 2D Survivors style game with rogue lite elements while focusing on simple game mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth has thought we were alone in the universe for far too long. Dark slumbering gods have now awoken and returned from beyond the depths of the void to teach humanity a lesson.  Fight against Cthulhu and his hordes until your inevitable death comes to claim  you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995740/extras/9349dd163eb6d8c7bd08ea6cd47c24b4.poster.avif?t=1785602784\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995740/extras/9349dd163eb6d8c7bd08ea6cd47c24b4.webm?t=1785602784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995740/extras/9349dd163eb6d8c7bd08ea6cd47c24b4.mp4?t=1785602784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as unique characters with their own special weapons -  each one unlocked via in game achievements or progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map has a unique environment that offers new areas to explore, special enemy appearances as well as challenges and secrets to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mini-boss Encounters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995740/extras/686c3daa414bee4c44a1820329ac204c.poster.avif?t=1785602784\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995740/extras/686c3daa414bee4c44a1820329ac204c.webm?t=1785602784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995740/extras/686c3daa414bee4c44a1820329ac204c.mp4?t=1785602784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unique mini-boss encounters on each level with special abilities that add to the challenge to defeat these elite strength enemies in order to make it to the final round and face Cthulhu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your upgrades carefully to construct a powerful kit against the upcoming challenges each level - mixing and matching abilities to form interesting combinations each play through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the defense  of earth and humanity in the battle against Cthulhu and his endless hordes today!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FACEMELTER is a 2D Survivors style game with rogue lite elements while focusing on simple game mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth has thought we were alone in the universe for far too long. Dark slumbering gods have now awoken and returned from beyond the depths of the void to teach humanity a lesson.  Fight against Cthulhu and his hordes until your inevitable death comes to claim  you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995740/extras/9349dd163eb6d8c7bd08ea6cd47c24b4.poster.avif?t=1785602784\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995740/extras/9349dd163eb6d8c7bd08ea6cd47c24b4.webm?t=1785602784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995740/extras/9349dd163eb6d8c7bd08ea6cd47c24b4.mp4?t=1785602784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as unique characters with their own special weapons -  each one unlocked via in game achievements or progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map has a unique environment that offers new areas to explore, special enemy appearances as well as challenges and secrets to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mini-boss Encounters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995740/extras/686c3daa414bee4c44a1820329ac204c.poster.avif?t=1785602784\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995740/extras/686c3daa414bee4c44a1820329ac204c.webm?t=1785602784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995740/extras/686c3daa414bee4c44a1820329ac204c.mp4?t=1785602784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unique mini-boss encounters on each level with special abilities that add to the challenge to defeat these elite strength enemies in order to make it to the final round and face Cthulhu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your upgrades carefully to construct a powerful kit against the upcoming challenges each level - mixing and matching abilities to form interesting combinations each play through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the defense  of earth and humanity in the battle against Cthulhu and his endless hordes today!</p>", "short_description": "FACEMELTER is a 2D Survivors style game with rogue lite elements. Focusing on simple game mechanics. Choose powerful weapons and upgrade them, discover secret champions and battle endless waves of enemies across the solar system and beyond.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995740/d099668d4084595410c392c863700a3eba8685c7/header.jpg?t=1785602784", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995740/7b069d48501d06ec9ff551a4f4eb28b112f90cdb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785602784", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995740/7b069d48501d06ec9ff551a4f4eb28b112f90cdb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785602784", "website": "https://doommetalgames.com/games/1", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX11, DX12 capable</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["DOOM METAL GAMES"], "publishers": ["DOOM METAL GAMES"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 18, "description": "Partial Control